{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/pulls/21","id":3944339838,"node_id":"PR_kwDOS9rTN87rGdl-","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/pull/21","diff_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/pull/21.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao/red/pull/21.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/issues/21","number":21,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(theme): restore red brand tokens","user":{"login":"flock-leader","id":295942454,"node_id":"U_kgDOEaO5Ng","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/295942454?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/flock-leader","html_url":"https://github.com/flock-leader","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flock-leader/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flock-leader/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flock-leader/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flock-leader/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flock-leader/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flock-leader/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flock-leader/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flock-leader/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/flock-leader/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Restore Red's CSS theme tokens on current `main` after the recent identity/template sync left the public accent and primary colors on the template blue hue.\n- Updates light and dark `--primary`, `--ring`, `--accent-*`, `--sidebar-primary`, and `--sidebar-ring` values to the red brand hue.\n\n## What changed on main\n\nCurrent `origin/main` includes PR #16 (`feat(identity): set repo-spec intent — hook + mission + brand{icon,color}`), which correctly set `.cogni/repo-spec.yaml` to `brand.color: \"#ef4444\"`, but `app/src/styles/tailwind.css` still had blue `217` tokens. That is why the live page showed a red icon but blue `/red`, headline gradient, CTA button, and spinner/accent controls.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Fetched current `origin/main` before patching.\n- Static token check passed for light/dark primary, ring, and accent variables.\n\n## Note\n\nLocal `typecheck` and dev rendering are currently blocked on unrelated `origin/main` package/export issues in `repoSpec.server.ts` / `@cogni/repo-spec`, before this CSS change is involved.\n","created_at":"2026-06-26T19:02:50Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T19:23:16Z","closed_at":"2026-06-26T19:23:15Z","merged_at":"2026-06-26T19:23:15Z","merge_commit_sha":"1138fc1c01284f4db8824225b71561093ce37bfb","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/pulls/21/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/pulls/21/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/issues/21/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cogni-dao/red/statuses/8d8d217eb6021a6ae1673c254a551931ef01380d","head":{"label":"cogni-dao:fix-red-theme","ref":"fix-red-theme","sha":"8d8d217eb6021a6ae1673c254a551931ef01380d","user":{"login":"cogni-dao","id":225770772,"node_id":"O_kgDODXT9FA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/225770772?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cogni-dao","html_url":"https://github.com/cogni-dao","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cogni-dao/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cogni-dao/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cogni-dao/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cogni-dao/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cogni-dao/subscriptions","organizations_url":"htt